WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.413 --> 00:00:03.196
Unit eight. Communication Skills!

2
00:00:04.131 --> 00:00:07.650
Hello, everyone! I'm Doctor Visal, your school doctor.

3
00:00:07.700 --> 00:00:10.689
Hi, Doctor Visal! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:10.739 --> 00:00:14.318
Today we learn about Communication Skills. Let's go!

5
00:00:15.433 --> 00:00:19.266
Active listening. Say it with me. Active listening!

6
00:00:22.819 --> 00:00:26.219
Assertive. Say it with me. Assertive!

7
00:00:29.659 --> 00:00:32.942
Passive. Say it with me. Passive!

8
00:00:36.459 --> 00:00:39.925
Aggressive. Say it with me. Aggressive!

9
00:00:43.459 --> 00:00:47.025
I-statement. Say it with me. I-statement!

10
00:00:50.512 --> 00:00:54.462
Body language. Say it with me. Body language!

11
00:00:58.004 --> 00:01:01.770
Empathy. Say it with me. Empathy!

12
00:01:05.223 --> 00:01:08.690
Feedback. Say it with me. Feedback!

13
00:01:12.168 --> 00:01:22.840
Assertive communication is clear and respectful, unlike passive or aggressive styles. Active listening, empathy, and I-statements improve relationships. Body language and feedback matter too.

14
00:01:22.890 --> 00:01:25.672
Now I understand. Thank you, Doctor Visal!

15
00:01:26.951 --> 00:01:32.252
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:32.302 --> 00:01:33.452
Passive!

17
00:01:34.292 --> 00:01:39.303
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:39.353 --> 00:01:40.503
Empathy!

19
00:01:41.358 --> 00:01:48.110
Did you know? A large part of communication comes from tone of voice and body language, not just words!

20
00:01:48.160 --> 00:01:49.966
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:01:50.672 --> 00:01:58.133
Think and answer. Give an example of an assertive response.

22
00:01:58.183 --> 00:01:59.333
Great answer!

23
00:02:00.509 --> 00:02:05.108
Great job today! Stay healthy, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:05.158 --> 00:02:07.716
Goodbye, everyone! Stay healthy!

